Dear Captain
Thank you for your attention and support to Star Wings! As the operation team of Starward, we are committed to creating a civilized, healthy, and peaceful gaming environment, providing players with a better gaming experience. We call on our users to strictly abide by laws and regulations, be tolerant of each other, and coexist harmoniously.

[b]一、 Adhere to game guidelines:[/b]
1. Civilized gaming, respect others, abide by game rules, and refrain from using any cheating tools or cheating tools to ensure game fairness;
2. Respect teammates, unite and cooperate, and work together to achieve game goals;
3. Do not insult, provoke, or defame other players, do not engage in personal attacks inside or outside the game, and maintain a harmonious atmosphere in the game community. We will crack down severely on insults, insults, and even illegal remarks that occur during game activities in accordance with the law. For users who infringe on rights and violate laws and regulations, we will impose penalties such as prohibition, temporary or permanent account suspension, depending on the situation;
4. Consciously maintain game order, do not intentionally create opposing situations in the game, and do not violate game rules;
5. Do not engage in any form of political behavior in the game (including but not limited to chatting, renaming). Once discovered, we will take strict measures, including disciplinary measures such as banning words and account suspension;

[b]二、 Maintaining a fair competitive environment:[/b]
1. Do not engage in fake matches: No one is allowed to collude privately to engage in fake matches. Once verified, strict punishment will be imposed;
2. No account theft: It is not allowed to obtain other people's accounts through illegal means, and the fairness of the game is respected;
3. Do not avoid the battle situation: In the game, one should bravely face challenges, not avoid the battle situation, and treat the game with an honest attitude.

[b]三、 Adhere to Code of Conduct:[/b]
1. Do not harass others: Do not harass other players, including in terms of language, actions, etc;
2. Do not spread false information: Do not spread false information in the game, and do not use rumors to affect the stability of the game community;
3. Do not publish advertisements: Do not publish advertisements in the game, and do not use the game platform for commercial activities.
We welcome gamers to report infringement or illegal activities through official channels. We sincerely look forward to all players working together with us to create a more civilized and harmonious gaming environment.
